If loading the project choices fails, interactive create reports the error like any other failure: no stack trace and nothing created.
-- env --
LINEAR_TEAM_KEY=ENG
LINEAR_ISSUE_CREATE_ASSIGN_SELF=never
LINEAR_ISSUE_CREATE_ASK_PROJECT=true
-- faults.json --
[{"on": "query:projects", "action": "status", "status": 200, "body": {"data": null, "errors": [{"message": "Projects unavailable"}]}}]
-- tty --
expect What's the title of your issue?
send Draft\r
expect Description
send \r
-- run --
linear issue create
-- stdout --
{{*}}✗ Failed to create issue: Projects unavailable
-- exit --
1
-- mutations.json --
{}
